#: ../../../reference/maskedarray.generic.rst:410
msgid ""
"When accessing a slice, the output is a masked array "
"whose :attr:`~MaskedArray.data` attribute is a view of the original data, "
"and whose mask is either :attr:`nomask` (if there was no invalid entries in "
"the original array) or a view of the corresponding slice of the original "
"mask. The view is required to ensure propagation of any modification of the "
"mask to the original."
msgstr ""

